usage: run_product_study.py [-h]
                            {validate,export-base,summarize,check-sandbox,qualify,run-dev,evaluate}
                            ...

Validate study inputs, export isolated base trees, or summarize raw trials.
Live trials require independent qualified data and an external agent
controller. This command deliberately cannot invent trials or native IDE
usage.

positional arguments:
  {validate,export-base,summarize,check-sandbox,qualify,run-dev,evaluate}

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
